There are 57 single operand shaders implemented by this one set of main
source files. For this operations there are done on the component floats.
The 3 starred cases (*) take a float in but produce an integer.

ND_<op>_<variant>

                                             OP
VARIANT    |floor ceil round absval sign sin cos tan asin acos sqrt ln
integer    | *X  | *X | *X  |      |    |   |   |   |    |    |    |
float      |  X  |  X |  X  |  X   | X  | X | X | X |  X |  X |  X | X
vector2    |  X  |  X |  X  |  X   | X  | X | X | X |  X |  X |  X | X
vector3    |  X  |  X |  X  |  X   | X  | X | X | X |  X |  X |  X | X
vector4    |  X  |  X |  X  |  X   | X  | X | X | X |  X |  X |  X | X
color3     |  X  |  X |  X  |  X   | X  |   |   |   |    |    |    |
color4     |  X  |  X |  X  |  X   | X  |   |   |   |    |    |    |
